 value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids August to September, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 49% of normal in August to September and 54% in September to October. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 164% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 24773 had its driest year in 1963 at 69%.</p>"}
